This package bundles and adapts material from GoogleChrome/modern-web-guidance
(https://github.com/GoogleChrome/modern-web-guidance), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Bundled without modification:
  - data/guides.json and data/guides/**/*.md — the Modern Web Guidance use-case corpus
    (version 0.0.197, skill version 2026_10_30-58d055df)
  - data/skills/chrome-extensions/** — the Chrome extensions skill
    (skill version 2026_08_06-8570fe7c)

Adapted:
  - data/skills/modern-web-guidance/SKILL.md — rewritten for this plugin: it instructs
    the agent to call the plugin's local tools instead of the upstream `npx` CLI, and it
    drops the upstream CLI/telemetry sections. The guidance content itself is unchanged.

Removed: the upstream `modern-web-guidance` CLI (search.mjs, modern-web.mjs), the bundled
TensorFlow.js MiniLM embedder, the usage-vectors file, and the Google Clearcut telemetry
watchdog. This package performs local lexical search instead and sends no telemetry.
